+  // it makes the extension order FIXED and therefore maximally fingerprintable.
+  // Only set it to emulate a client that genuinely does not permute, and pair
+  // it with an explicit fp_extension_order so the result is deterministic
+  // rather than merely constant.
+  std::optional<bool> fp_permute_extensions;
